      ],
      "source": "https://www.georgetownct.org/history",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After closing in the late 1980s, Georgetown reclaimed the mill in 2021 and is remediating it for new uses.",
